OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer blamed stranger for sex
OL,4,Aworker contacts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Leicestershire Police officer has
OL,7,Fclaimed their phone was used to contact
OL,8,Fsex workers after letting someone they
OL,9,Fdid not know borrow it on a night out.
OL,11,FA gross misconduct hearing at
OL,12,FLeicestershire Police's headquarters in
OL,13,FEnderby on Wednesday heard a police
OL,14,Fofficer was accused of attempting to
OL,15,Fcontact sex workers and being
OL,16,Fdishonest.
OL,18,FDespite an application by the Local
OL,19,FDemocracy Reporting Service, hearing
OL,20,Fchair Julia Debenham ruled the officer
OL,21,Fwould remain anonymous.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
