OL,5,
OL,6,FThe officer is the third Leicestershire
OL,7,FPolice officer to face a misconduct
OL,8,Fhearing over contact with sex workers
OL,9,Fin less than two months - all have been
OL,10,Fgranted anonymity, the Local Democracy
OL,11,FReporting Service said.
